 "brief": "Avigdor Lieberman, leader of the Yisrael Beitenu party, leveled sharp criticism at Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu, accusing him of military failure during a visit to the Nova festival site near the Reim settlement in Gaza's perimeter, Shehab Wire reported. Lieberman's remarks centered on the absence of a decisive military outcome after three years of conflict.\n\nThe criticism emerged as Lieberman toured the location where the October 7 attack was launched, framing his comments as a response to what he characterized as shocking revelations about leadership decisions on the night of the Hamas-led assault.",
